        acquisition = "Difficulty: Easy - Enroll through the short Argent Tournament introduction; the later training ranks are separate.\n\n1. Travel to Justicar Mariel Trueheart inside the Argent pavilion at the Argent Tournament Grounds, northern Icecrown (69.6, 22.8). Enable Trivial Quests and accept The Argent Tournament.\n\n2. Follow its faction-specific introduction to Arcanist Taelis in the Alliance pavilion (76.4, 19.4) or Magister Edien Sunhollow in the Horde pavilion (76.2, 24.2). Turn in the introduction to enrol as an Aspirant and receive this achievement.\n\n3. Take the lance/mounted-training lessons for further progression. Fifteen Aspirant's Seals and the later Aspirant's Challenge are for Argent Valor; they are not prerequisites for this enrollment achievement.",
