    [2777] = {
        achievementId = 2777,
        name = "Champion of Darnassus",
        category = "Argent Tournament",
        sourceType = "Achievement",
        source = "Champion of Darnassus",
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Medium - Complete one city's Valiant training and challenge; Exalted variants also require that city's reputation grind.\n\n1. Reach Valiant through the Argent Aspiration/Argent Valor introduction. If Darnassus is not the first city offered to your character, finish that first city's championship before selecting another. Only ONE city's Valiant training can be active at a time.\n\n2. Speak to Jaelyne Evensong in the Alliance pavilion at 76.2, 19 in Icecrown. Accept the invitation to represent Darnassus and The Valiant's Charge. Already being Exalted with the city does not replace the tournament training.\n\n3. Complete that city's available Valiant dailies: the weapon errand, A Valiant's Field Training, The Grand Melee and At the Enemy's Gates. Turn them in for Valiant's Seals and continue after daily resets until you have TWENTY-FIVE. Aspirant's Seals and Champion's Seals are different currencies/items.\n\n4. Complete only today's weapon errand: A Blade Fit For A Champion uses Warts-B-Gone Lip Balm before EACH /kiss on a Lake Frog at Grizzly Hills 60.5, 51.5; speak to the revealed Maiden. A Worthy Weapon needs FOUR Winter Hyacinths from the Decrepit Flow (Crystalsong 12, 16), used inside the flower circle at Drak'Mar Lake (Dragonblight 93.1, 25.9); wait and LOOT the sword. The Edge of Winter needs Lord Everblaze's ember (Crystalsong 55.5, 74.9), used on the frozen Maiden at Winter's Breath Lake (Howling Fjord 42.2, 19.6). Return the obtained weapon to your own quest giver.\n\n5. For field training, kill the requested eligible Scourge in Icecrown. For At the Enemy's Gates, take a provided campaign mount near the Court of Bones, maintain Defend, use Shield-Breaker on flyers and strip enemy riders' shields before charging. For The Grand Melee, defeat the requested city Valiants in the tournament rings. Equip the lance and mount an eligible tournament steed. Build THREE Defend stacks (action 4) before challenging. Use Thrust (1) in melee; when the enemy rides away, Charge (3) as soon as range allows, then Shield-Breaker (2) while turning back to melee. Refresh Defend when a stack is lost. Heal between bouts.\n\n6. Turn in the twenty-five seals to Jaelyne Evensong, accept The Valiant's Challenge, then speak to Squire Danny at about 68.6, 20.9 while on the tournament mount with the lance equipped. Defeat his summoned Argent Champion; Danny does not start the bout for an ordinary unmounted visitor.\n\n7. Return to Jaelyne Evensong and turn in the challenge to become Champion of Darnassus. Finish A Champion Rises when first offered. You retain earlier city championships when choosing a new Valiant city; the basic Champion achievement does not require Exalted.",
        stepCount = 7,
        waypoints = {
            { mapID = 118, x = 0.762, y = 0.19, step = 2, label = "Jaelyne Evensong - Darnassus Valiant invitation" },
            { mapID = 118, x = 0.762, y = 0.19, step = 3, label = "City dailies - 25 Valiant's Seals" },
            { mapID = 118, x = 0.75, y = 0.18, step = 5, label = "Alliance Valiants' Ring - Grand Melee" },
            { mapID = 118, x = 0.75, y = 0.26, step = 5, label = "Horde Valiants' Ring - Grand Melee" },
            {
                mapID = 118,
