        acquisition = "Difficulty: Hard - Champion all five home cities through consecutive daily training stages; Exalted variants add all required reputations.\n\n1. Enrol and reach Valiant through the Argent Aspiration/Argent Valor guides. Finish the first city offered to your character, then choose the other cities one at a time. The five Horde cities are Orgrimmar, Sen'jin, Silvermoon City, Thunder Bluff and the Undercity.\n\n2. For EACH city, accept its Valiant invitation, earn twenty-five Valiant's Seals through its dailies, turn in The Valiant's Charge, and defeat Squire Danny's Argent Champion for The Valiant's Challenge. Return for that city's final hand-in before starting another city. Use the individual city guides for the full weapon errands and mounted tasks.\n\n3. Continue unlocked Champion dailies alongside the currently selected city's Valiant work. Changing cities keeps your previous Champion ranks. Shared dailies already completed that day do not necessarily reappear for the new city; continue after reset.\n\n4. Raise all five corresponding CITY reputations to Exalted as well. Each Exalted Champion guide includes the current physical city-tabard seller and repeatable Normal Botanica route. Sen'jin uses Darkspear Trolls reputation. Buying a city mount or merely being Champion is insufficient.\n\n5. Reach Exalted with ARGENT CRUSADE in addition to the five Exalted city championships. At Friendly, buy its tabard from Aliocha Segard at Argent Vanguard (87.6, 75.6), equip it and clear eligible original Wrath Heroic dungeons. Argent Dawn and Knights of the Ebon Blade do not substitute.\n\n6. Check all meta criteria for the Crusader title/unlock. Account-wide completed city achievements can contribute, so inspect existing progress before repeating a whole city on an alt. The individual city quest chains and ordinary Champion activities still have their own character progression.",
