        acquisition = "Difficulty: Easy - Defeat the required legacy raid bosses in the correct size and mode, allowing scripted events to finish.\n\n1. Set Legacy Raid Size to 25 players outside, fly to Wintergrasp Fortress and enter the Vault of Archavon portal at 50.0, 11.0. This is the outdoor Northrend zone, not the queued Epic Battleground. If access is closed, use the faction-control state shown in that zone.\n\n2. Take the first eastern side chamber to Emalon and his four Tempest Minions. Kill Emalon promptly; if he survives long enough to overcharge a minion, kill that enlarged minion before it reaches ten stacks.\n\n3. Check the named Watcher's achievement for this size before leaving. A 25-player kill does not substitute for the separate 10-player criterion.",
